			"gloss": "<i>Shin</i> (<he>שׂ</he> Sin), the twenty-first letter of the alphabet.—<cite ref=\"U00000\"><he>שׁ</he></cite> interchanges with <cite ref=\"V00000\"><he>ת</he></cite>, e.g. <cite ref=\"U00311\"><he>שׁוּב</he></cite>, ch. <cite ref=\"V00142\"><he>תּוּב</he></cite>; <cite ref=\"N01345\"><he>נָשַׁר</he></cite> ch. <cite ref=\"N01392\"><he>נְתר</he></cite>; <cite ref=\"Q02098\"><he>פָּשַׁר</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"Q02200\"><he>פָּתַר</he></cite> &c.—<he>שׂ</he> interchanges with <cite ref=\"O00000\"><he>ס</he></cite> and <cite ref=\"G00000\"><he>ז</he></cite> q. v.—<cite ref=\"U00000\"><he>שׁ</he></cite> a formative letter (for <i>Shafel</i>), e.g. <cite ref=\"U00720\"><he>שִׁחֲרֵר</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"U00720\"><he>שַׁחְרֵר</he></cite>, <cite ref=\"U01216\"><he>שִׁלְהֵב</he></cite> &c.",
